{"schemaVersion":2,"sectionID":9792,"chapterID":76,"chapterNumber":"3","sectionNumber":"28-324.1.1","title":"§ 28-324.1.1 Covered buildings and structures.","sourceHTMLPath":"code-sections/general-administrative-provisions/chapters/Chapter 3.html","blocks":[{"id":"9792-html-1","kind":"html","html":"</div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-159250\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-159250\"></AnnotationDrawer><div>Such buildings or structures include: </div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-159251\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-159251\"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;1.&#160;&#160;&#160;new construction;</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-159252\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-159252\"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;2.&#160;&#160;&#160;substantial improvements;</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-159253\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-159253\"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;3.&#160;&#160;&#160;such portions of buildings or structures that are horizontal enlargements.</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-159254\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-159254\"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(L.L. 2021/126, 11/7/2021, eff. 11/7/2022) \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-159255\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-159255\"></AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"EdNoteSm\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Editor's note:</span> For related unconsolidated provisions, see Appendix A at <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '/codes/newyorkcity/latest/NYCadmin/0-0-0-135195', hash: '#JD_L.L.2021/126' }}\">L.L. 2021/126</Link>. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div></div>","plainText":"Such buildings or structures include: 1. new construction; 2. substantial improvements; 3. such portions of buildings or structures that are horizontal enlargements. (L.L. 2021/126, 11/7/2021, eff. 11/7/2022) Editor's note: For related unconsolidated provisions, see Appendix A at L.L. 2021/126 ."}]}
